# Reaches Rebel's package `net`, so that `heroes test` on this file runs the
# tests of its face, its private modules and the floors under them (spec
# § 12). It prints the IPv6 loopback address as the package writes it, `::1`,
# on every run, touching no network.

use <rebel>/net

function main()
    print(net.format_host(net.loopback_v6()))
